            "sid": "JER 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jeremia achiaambira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Muambireni Zedekiya, Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli anaamba, ‘Lola, nindausa silaha za viha zirizo mwenu mikononi ambazo mngehumira kupigira viha mfalume wa Babeli na jeshi ra Akalidayo ambao akauzangira nyo mudzi wenu. Chisha nindaareha ro jeshi ra maadui hadi kahi-kahi ya nyo mudzi wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi mwenye ndapigana namwi kpwa nguvu zangu zosi na tsukizi nyinji kpwa sababu mkanireyeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindaapiga osi asagalao mumu mudzini ikale ni mwanadamu ama ni nyama, andaolagbwa ni ukongo mui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu naamba, nindamlavya Zedekiya mfalume wa Juda, atumishie na atu a nyo mudzi ambao andatiya ukongo mui, upanga au ndzala niatiye mikononi mwa Nebukadineza, mfalume wa Babeli, na mikononi mwa maadui genu alondao kukuangamizani. Iye andakuolagani kpwa upanga, kandakujalini, kandakusazani wala kukuswameheni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaidi ya gago, aambire nyo atu kukala Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, ‘Nakuphani njira mbiri mtsambule, njira ya uzima na njira ya chifo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu yeyesi ndiyesala mumu mudzini andaolagbwa na upanga, ndzala au ukongo mui. Ela ndiyetuluka kondze na kudzisalimisha kpwa Akalidayo ndiokala akakuzungulukani andatiya. Na uhai wao undakala ndiyo zewe achiyophaha vihani.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nkakata shauri kuuhendera mudzi uhu mai wala si manono, undatiywa mikononi mwa mfalume wa Babeli naye andautiya moho uphye, mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkaamba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
